         optimized_tiles_surfaces;           /**< Cache of drawn non-animated tiles for each cell. */
 
+    // [MiSTer partial-tile-fill FIX] The non-animated tiles that record_static() emits,
+    // kept in MAP (painter's) order. record_static() MUST emit in this order, not the
+    // Grid's home-cell order: a wide/tall foreground tile recorded at its top-left home
+    // cell would otherwise be overtaken by background tiles with later home cells that
+    // overlap its right/lower extent, drawing the background ON TOP of the decoration
+    // (the "partial tile / bgcolor fill" bug). Populated in build(); excludes animated
+    // tiles and tiles overlapping animated squares (those go to the animated walk).
+    std::vector<TileInfo> mister_record_order;
+
 };
 
 }
